  "title": {
   "en": "Furyou Shounen ni Meshi wo Kuwasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "不良少年に飯を食わす"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Yuri Moriyama, an office worker, is happily married to her boyfriend of five years. However, she is thrown into the depths of unhappiness when she discovers that he had an affair with a junior colleague of Yuri's. Unable to contain her anger toward her ex-lover, Yuri goes to a park and gets drunk. She gets tangled up with some bad guys and is saved by a blonde-haired delinquent named Shoa, who actually lives in the same apartment. In fact, Shoa lives in the same apartment building as Yuri, but his mother is in the hospital and he is not eating well.",
   "ja": "森山ゆり、27歳。営業職としてバリバリ働く彼女は、５年間付き合った同じ会社の先輩と婚約中！彼のために食事を作る毎日、幸せの絶頂―――かと思いきや、ある日「会社の後輩を妊娠させた」と告白され、婚約破棄をされてしまう。そんな時、お腹をすかせた少年・星亜に出会い…？"
  },
